    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi082C7wrfxzN-HzcgbHF93aZYAJ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>*声明：故事内容均来自网络相关事实报道，节目中的观点仅代表主播个人，节目内容仅供参考，并不具备完全的客观性及权威性，一切以事实为准。</span></p><span></span><p><span>*本期节目涉及灵异怪谈故事描述，可选择性收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>*感谢听友</span><strong><span>看报的喵喵喵喵喵、 萧山月 、 HD1006775z 、与你_FY55、 廉_FGGb、刺猬的坚强、毛茸茸的塑料袋、瑶-VuC5、柚时</span></strong><span>对围炉夜谭的大力支持，我们会承蒙大家喜爱与支持，继续努力作出更好的作品！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>亦真亦假、有虚有实、分享一些传言、鬼畜和奇遇，一年一度清明特辑panda和气气的怪话连篇......</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 前言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1278">21:18</a> &nbsp;西安美院格局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1278">21:18</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> 三安大厦地下闹鬼事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2257">37:37</a>交大东四“自杀楼”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2257">37:37</a>- &nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2505">41:45</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;见龙预知？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2505">41:45</a>后 梦中铁臂阿童木事件</span></p><span></span><p><span>【相关图片】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkZm61lcS6ed1V8fhfae9vO7qk8n.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>常年紧闭的大门</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhr3uegan5jLNbunrjKhtOQA0JhP.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>校园中的拴马桩</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk6WhZOIn8BfLBbiejMcKh0e3Ixj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>高德地图中的太极湖</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpL-ZD2XWZrz422frC