    <title>EP.30 辛西娅的噩梦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690b7532af4fc00da750f981</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">690b7532af4fc00da750f981</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Nov 2025 16:55:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fphk_IQH1veFYcC7dBLT--_eDdrC.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>*本期节目无过度血腥暴力或恐怖内容，全年龄段可收听。</span></p><span></span><h1><span>*声明：故事内容均来自网络相关事实报道，节目中的观点仅代表主播个人，节目内容仅供参考，并不具备完全的客观性及权威性，一切以事实为准。</span></h1><span></span><p><span>*感谢听友</span><strong><span>看报的喵喵喵喵喵、 萧山月 、 HD1006775z &nbsp;、与你_FY55、 廉_FGGb、刺猬的坚强</span></strong><span>对围炉夜谭的大力支持，我们会承蒙大家喜爱与支持，继续努力作出更好的作品！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>有时候，一个极其逼真、充满细节的噩梦，会像一片阴霾一样缠绕你一整天，甚至更久。而如果这个梦，在未来的某一天，真的在现实中上演了呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们要聊的，正是这样一个关于“噩梦成真”的故事。它发生在美国俄亥俄州，主角是一位名叫辛西娅的女士。她的噩梦，不仅仅是一个梦，更像是一份来自未知的死亡预告。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 一些废话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">05:49</a> 辛西娅的噩梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1027">17:07</a> &nbsp;辛西娅的失踪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1693">28:13</a> 案件后续</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1877">31:17</a> &nbsp;头脑风暴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2566">42:46</a> 尾声</span></p><span></span><p><span>【相关图片】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fln8fbewnMZq0eT1m12ltG-bEtPm.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>辛西娅的妹妹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhaki1oTvgS79QtH7V2RoG7TOPGZ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>辛西娅的雇主</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgdZumuiNc3HQzwxre2JHFU9HSl8.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>辛西娅一家</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FspGa3COs69hcGhXprugORoHCztj.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>辛西娅的爸爸</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiBh2cDPtHFr5bng0zdiTfWGSotA.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>辛西娅的寻人启事</span></p><span></span><p><span>【信源】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://websleuths.com/threads/oh-cynthia-cindy-anderson-20-toledo-4-aug-1981.78469/" href="https://websleuths.com/threads/oh-cynthia-cindy-anderson-20-toledo-4-aug-1981.78469/">websleuths.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://websleuths.com/threads/cynthia-jane-anderson-20-toledo-oh-1981.114655/" href="https://websleuths.com/threads/cynthia-jane-anderson-20-toledo-oh-1981.114655/">websleuths.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://unsolved.com/gallery/cynthia-anderson/" href="https://unsolved.com/gallery/cynthia-anderson/">unsolved.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X11R90OOiEc&amp;t=39s" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X11R90OOiEc&amp;t=39s">www.youtube.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.reddit.com/r/UnresolvedMysteries/comments/4ggcul/cynthia_anderson_had_nightmares_about_being/?tl=zh-hans" href="https://www.reddit.com/r/UnresolvedMysteries/comments/4ggcul/cynthia_anderson_had_nightmares_about_being/?tl=zh-hans">www.reddit.com</a></span><br><span><a data-url="https://www.toledoblade.com/local/2011/08/04/Woman-s-disappearance-a-mystery-after-30-years.html" href="https://www.toledoblade.com/local/2011/08/04/Woman-s-disappearance-a-mystery-after-30-years.html">www.toledoblade.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
