    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fphk_IQH1veFYcC7dBLT--_eDdrC.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>*本期节目无过度血腥暴力或恐怖内容，全年龄段可收听。</span></p><span></span><h1><span>*声明：故事内容均来自网络相关事实报道，节目中的观点仅代表主播个人，节目内容仅供参考，并不具备完全的客观性及权威性，一切以事实为准。</span></h1><span></span><p><span>*感谢听友</span><strong><span>看报的喵喵喵喵喵、 萧山月 、 HD1006775z &nbsp;、与你_FY55、 廉_FGGb</span></strong><span>对围炉夜谭的大力支持，我们会承蒙大家喜爱与支持，继续努力作出更好的作品！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个关于19岁少女、失踪的富豪老板、大学与天上人间的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> 漫谈：地域、凶案、刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> 不回家的男人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 护城河现尸块</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> “天上人间”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 公主、少爷和金主：张超、谢宏和木鸿章</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 她陷入情网，他织起蛛丝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3387">56:27</a> 庭审与判决</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3916">01:05:16</a> 结语</span></p><span></span><p><span>【相关图片】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjuNRP1P6VUr2Jb3zN8FqUdkWNUk.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>张超 形象照</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrK-l93S6HEDSdJaEsXGHPDwpjzK.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>张超男友谢宏</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhyXgumNec0XrSe-ODfbVoGaO0kE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>木鸿章的帕拉丁示意</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiQIgzaKM5nBWIOZDWtKI5LCVeA0.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>张超当庭下跪</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlN_ZXgC3BDmk_AuaUh3XOl_-SJb.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>张超、谢宏与陈光吕</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案 气气</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期 Panda</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>王菲-人间</span></p><span></span><p><span>孟庭苇-风中有朵雨做的云</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvbMCBo1LH4jsSEbLCANVuBrpUhV.png"></figure>]]></description>
