  <item>
    <title>EP.28 无法回家的旅途</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68f6753a456ffec65eb80824</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68f6753a456ffec65eb80824</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 17:50:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fphk_IQH1veFYcC7dBLT--_eDdrC.png"></figure><p><span>*本期节目无过度血腥暴力或恐怖元素内容，全年龄段可收听。</span></p><h1><span>*声明：故事内容均来自网络相关事实报道，节目中的观点仅代表主播个人，节目内容仅供参考，并不具备完全的客观性及权威性，一切以事实为准。</span></h1><p><span>*感谢听友看报的喵喵喵喵喵、 萧山月 、 HD1006775z &nbsp;、与你_FY55、 廉_FGGb对围炉夜谭的大力支持，我们会承蒙大家喜爱与支持，继续努力作出更好的作品！</span></p><p><span>【简介】</span></p><p><span>15岁的林珺正坐在去往“天堂之岛”新喀里多尼亚群岛游学的路上，车内异常安静，因为此刻的她早已顾不上和前排开车的父亲交流，心已经飘去了那片海岛。</span></p><p><span>最后的交流只剩父亲林暋重复的唠叨，这些话从出发前就不断在耳边回想，早就让林珺的耳朵听出茧子了。</span></p><p><span>乘上飞机的林珺没有来得及向父亲挥手告别，她想着一周之后便能再见面，便没有过多停留，被同学拉上了飞机，开启了这“最接近天堂群岛”的梦幻之旅。</span></p><p><span>而此时的她并不知道，这一别，成了她半生的痛与遗憾。</span></p><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">04:11</a>——废话叨叨叨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="463">07:43</a>——林家背景</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a>——案发</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">21:37</a>——林家的葬礼以及凶手猜测</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a>——调查谢连斌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2002">33:22</a>——论谢连斌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2484">41:24</a>——谢连斌的伏法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2583">43:03</a>——谢连斌的审判</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2986">49:46</a>——七年半与明天</span></p><p><span>【相关图片】</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft7K2_-aKm9JEGdlq-EbY7tcMRsp.png"></figure><p><span>林家一家5口</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnLyx4IASx64QvAnY_-eHFDgFEo7.png"></figure><p><span>林姝（左）与林珺（右）</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrpvQPCD6ehwVDqzyiXWufE97AAW.png"></figure><p><span>林家格局简图</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoHGm5sVkbD-aH6aJh0EPP21fgyO.png"></figure><p><span>林家全家福</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkBQ5-_fNvwbfcYfv7Nqs10TCERk.png"></figure><p><span>五位受害者</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrjzZ-WSWwwMboLqB00yRVzoZ50t.png"></figure><p><span>谢连斌</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnqP8E2paj9tql9AS-DLLTyaUdEr.png"></figure><p><span>林家二老</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs7xTJcFf6kRPP0ni4gwPBLhou_B.png"></figure><p><span>谢连斌</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk1lFP-5YiUks28eWk1mZbVcgDiH.png"></figure><p><span>信源：</span></p><p><span><a data-url="https://www.dailymail.co.uk/news/article-4238570/Robert-Xie-seen-touching-Brenda-Lin-uncomfortable-way.html" href="https://www.dailymail.co.uk/news/article-4238570/Robert-Xie-seen-touching-Brenda-Lin-uncomfortable-way.html">www.dailymail.co.uk</a></span></p><p><span><a data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YsDHxzjPogE" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YsDHxzjPogE">www.youtube.com</a></span></p><p><span><a data-url="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lin_family_murders_" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lin_family_murders_">en.wikipedia.org</a>(Australia)</span></p><p><span><a data-url="https://7news.com.au/news/crime/mass-murderer-xies-appeal-decision-due-c-2164283" href="https://7news.com.au/news/crime/mass-murderer-xies-appeal-decision-due-c-2164283">7news.com.au</a></span><br></p>]]></description>
